# Half-Life tripmine. Measured by vrcardgen, finished by hand.
#
# Part J: "Hold it to a wall: a ghost shows where it will sit. Press it to
# the surface and it attaches there, oriented to the surface, and arms."
#
# No moving parts, no pin, no fuse. A tripmine arms where it is put, so
# releasing it against a surface is the whole mechanism - and finding the
# surface is the world's job, not the weapon's.

weapon v_tripmine
match  bones 32  seqs 9  hash 0x79d3e7d9

type   thrown
fuse   0           # it arms where it is placed
